      "writtenOn": "2022-02-23T09:59:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This particular call is conditional on it being for a protected VM. I agree that there is value for both calls, but VMs in protected mode are special, so wouldn\u0027t make sense to have a special load for them? This hypercall is prefixed with __pkvm, so it doesn\u0027t work for non-protected KVM anyway.\n\nI agree about fusing it with the call below. I\u0027ll add a patch do do that (same for the put)",
      "parentUuid": "832d0760_543be9ec",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 582,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 584,
        "endChar": 42
      },
