      "writtenOn": "2022-02-23T10:27:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But my point is that there should be a single vcpu_load() hypercall for both protected and non-protected modes, because there is a lot of stuff that could be moved to a single hcall. I don\u0027t think they should be different.",
